8) Edge Cases & Rules (explicit)

Multiple fib setups in same day

Only count first occurrence. Use fibSessionCountedToday to guard.

No zone touch

If price never touches 38.2, then no touch counters increment (except totalFibSetups already counted).

If it still hits 0 without touching 38 (trend day), it will register as a WIN day optionally, but conditional stats won’t include it (fine).

Resolution without zone touch

Allowed. Does not affect conditional win rates since denominators are touch counters.

OPEN outcomes

If neither 0 nor 100 touched by EOD, commit as OPEN.

OPEN does not count toward failures or wins.

Tie-breaker

If both 0 and 100 touched same bar: LOSS.

Strict touches only (V1)

No tolerance. V2 may add ATR/tick tolerance.

